ip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a 15\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem lugar no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com secretariado, partida e chegada no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o da ACR Santa Cita<\/strong>, no concelho de Tomar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza o <strong>Trail Longo 32 km<\/strong> (08:30), o <strong>Trail Curto 20 km<\/strong> (09:00), o <strong>Mini Trail 14 km<\/strong> (09:15) e a <strong>Experi\u00eancia Trail \/ Caminhada 10 km<\/strong> (09:30).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova pontua para circuitos oficiais da modalidade?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o evento integra os <strong>Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP<\/strong> (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal) e o <strong>Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O evento inclui refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova para os atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es contemplam o j\u00e1 tradicional e elogiado <strong>almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio<\/strong> servido no pavilh\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o dos percursos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os tempos e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis em direto atrav\u00e9s da plataforma de cronometragem e no portal Portugal Running logo ap\u00f3s a cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dios.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XV Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o ACR Santa Cita, Tomar\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Tomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ACR Santa Cita\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a 15\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem lugar no domingo, 27 de Setembro de 2026 , com secretariado, partida e chegada no Pavilh\u00e3o da ACR Santa Cita , no concelho de Tomar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza o Trail Longo 32 km (08:30), o Trail Curto 20 km (09:00), o Mini Trail 14 km (09:15) e a Experi\u00eancia Trail \/ Caminhada 10 km (09:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova pontua para circuitos oficiais da modalidade?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o evento integra os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal) e o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O evento inclui refei\u00e7\u00e3o p\u00f3s-prova para os atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es contemplam o j\u00e1 tradicional e elogiado almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio servido no pavilh\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o dos percursos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os tempos e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis em direto atrav\u00e9s da plataforma de cronometragem e no portal Portugal Running logo ap\u00f3s a cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dios.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68021,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53154","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tomar-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-dos-templarios.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53154","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=53154"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53154\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68023,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53154\/revisions\/68023"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/68021"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=53154"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=53154"},